# Line endings.
#
# `deno fmt --check` fails on a CRLF working tree, and this project is developed
# on Windows where core.autocrlf=true — which rewrites every file to CRLF on
# checkout. Without this file a fresh clone could not reproduce the documented
# verification command, which is exit criterion 8.
#
# `eol=lf` takes precedence over core.autocrlf, so the working tree matches what
# the tests and the formatter expect on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
